From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:01:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/adbe: Report an eDP connector on A8 boards with the eDP
 transmitter

The A8's match data gives a MIPI DSI connector, the panel link of the
iPod touch 6 and the iPhone 6. The iPad mini 4 has the same display pipe
but drives an eDP panel through the DisplayPort transmitter. When the
pipe's node has the transmitter's "dp" window, register the connector as
eDP, so that it is named eDP-1 there and userspace sees the right panel
type. Nothing else changes: the driver still adopts the link iBoot left
running and never touches the transmitter unless a panel supply is given.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Link: https://github.com/OrchardLinux/orchard/pull/231#issuecomment-7138590680
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/adbe/adbe_drv.c | 15 +++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/adbe/adbe_drv.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/adbe/adbe_drv.c
index 0e93f9e..d4e4a5b 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/adbe/adbe_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/adbe/adbe_drv.c
@@ -252,7 +252,10 @@ MODULE_PARM_DESC(dart_scanout,
 struct adbe_hw {
 	/* SPDS version at ADP_SPDS that iOS requires; 0: iOS never reads it */
 	u16 spds_version;
-	/* The panel link iBoot left running */
+	/*
+	 * The panel link iBoot left running, unless the pipe has a "dp"
+	 * window: then the link is eDP.
+	 */
 	int connector_type;
 };
 
@@ -268,7 +271,8 @@ static const struct adbe_hw adbe_hw_s8000 = {
  * masks the same errors at start, but has no SPDS check: it reads the
  * display_spdsversion_mismatch_is_panic boot argument and never ADP_SPDS.
  * Neither does this driver there. The iPod touch 6 and the iPhone 6 drive
- * a MIPI DSI panel.
+ * a MIPI DSI panel; the iPad mini 4 drives eDP, and its pipe has the
+ * DisplayPort transmitter's "dp" window.
  */
 static const struct adbe_hw adbe_hw_t7000 = {
 	.spds_version = 0,
@@ -1915,7 +1919,7 @@ static int adbe_adopt(struct adbe *adbe)
 static int adbe_modeset_init(struct adbe *adbe)
 {
 	struct drm_device *drm = &adbe->drm;
-	int ret;
+	int connector_type, ret;
 
 	ret = drmm_mode_config_init(drm);
 	if (ret)
@@ -1950,8 +1954,11 @@ static int adbe_modeset_init(struct adbe *adbe)
 		return ret;
 	adbe->encoder.possible_crtcs = drm_crtc_mask(&adbe->crtc);
 
+	connector_type = adbe->hw->connector_type;
+	if (of_property_match_string(drm->dev->of_node, "reg-names", "dp") >= 0)
+		connector_type = DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_eDP;
 	ret = drmm_connector_init(drm, &adbe->connector, &adbe_connector_funcs,
-				  adbe->hw->connector_type, NULL);
+				  connector_type, NULL);
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 	drm_connector_helper_add(&adbe->connector, &adbe_connector_helper_funcs);
-- 
